<title>JAPAN: DSL Bank launches 30 bln yen 5.4% yen/A$ samurai.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank launches 30 bln yen 5.4% yen/A$ samurai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai issue was announced by lead manager Nomura Securities on Wednesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  DSL Bank Deutsche Siedlungs-und Landesrentenbank</p>
<p> AMT		 30 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    5.4 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  29 March 1999</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
</text>
